  referenceImageName: Mural1
  displayName: Rooted
  location: Brick courtyard wall between two buildings, next to the Entry door
  physicalSizeMeters: {x: 5.6, y: 6.603}
  story: 'A woman painted straight onto the brick, crowned with a gold leaf and wearing
    gold hoops, stacked neck rings and a robe of patterned panels. The flat-topped
    trees behind her frame her like a quiet savannah, so she seems rooted in the
    land around her.


    Tap the trees to send a gust through them, or tap her
    earrings to catch the light.'
